                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8c52091e-27e5-3e9e-8d4c-11eb0314dc6a",
                        "entry_id": "47b1de29-1dce-33fb-b912-b70aad19f6c2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "triviality of subject matter, unwillingness to tackle important questions (of a conversation, a piece of writing, a work of art, etc.)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "40a5c140-858f-419c-b6a2-b275e0d02b4d",
                                "sense_id": "8c52091e-27e5-3e9e-8d4c-11eb0314dc6a",
                                "text": "Лишь во второ́й полови́не э́того десятиле́тия, пережи́в глубо́кое го́ре ― смерть молодо́й жены́, ― потря́сшее необыча́йно чу́ткого, впечатли́тельного Не́стерова, он ре́е́зко порыва́ет с передви́жническим реали́змом и мелкоте́мьем.",
                                "translation": "Only in the second half of the decade, after suffering a terrible tragedy, the death of his young wife, which had shaken the highly sensitive and impressive Nesterov, he abruptly abandons Itinerant realism and triviality of subject matter.",
                                "english": "Only in the second half of the decade, after suffering a terrible tragedy, the death of his young wife, which had shaken the highly sensitive and impressive Nesterov, he abruptly abandons Itinerant realism and triviality of subject matter."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
